WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.618
Jaba Lompo, jaagorɗo mawɗo. Gooto gooduɗo ko'e maɓɓe.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:19.506
Aadaaji feere-feere dow ko Gulmance'en fuɗɗii. Woɓɓe maɓɓe ɓe njaɓaayi bandugo ɓe bee Musa, ammaa ɓe mbi'i dow goɗɗo ƴiwoyi daga woɗɓe.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.184
Gooto nder maɓɓe wi'i Jaba Lompo ɗon dari diga asama e koyngal sendundu.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:51.256
O wari nder lesdi fuunaaŋge nder karnuwol sappo e tati.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.368
Yimɓe ɓeen ɗon mbaɗata ko'e maɓɓe.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.908
Ngaree to am ɓiɗɗo on.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:21.866
Sey o yaari ɓiɗɗo mo nyawɗo, ɓikkoy maako ummii. Ngam maajum min nana mo.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:48.528
O ɗon maɓɓita ko'e maɓɓe, o ɗon wi'a yeeso nder ɓoggi maɓɓe.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.256
O yi'i gariiri dow hooseere.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:07.056
Ɗon ɗon dow hooseere, gariiri mooɗon ɓadake.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.994
O yahi haa nokkuure nde'e, o wurtini laami maako, o wi'i: "Ɗum woni gariiri".

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.328
Kanjum woni bingo, mo laato Fada N'Gourma.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.144
Duuɗe ɗon ɓadito dow maɓɓere.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:03.072
Jaba Lompo jooɗii ton, kanko e hooreejo.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.392
En ngari diga toɗɗaaɗe ngam en ndaara mo.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.912
Ɓiɓɓe am, njooɗee laamiije goɗɗe.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:45.968
Ɓiɓɓe maako boo ɓe njehi haa nokkuure feere-feere ngam ɓe ɓesda lesdi.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:15.802
Hannde, Fada N'Gourma ɗon siftora mo fuɗɗiiɗo. Kanjum woni al'aadaaji feere-feere.
